John 7:1 , Jesus reproves the ambition and boldness of his kinsmen;
John 7:10 , goes up from Galilee to the feast of tabernacles;
John 7:14 , teaches in the temple;
John 7:40 , Divers opinions of him among the people;
John 7:45 , The Pharisees are angry that their officers took him not, and chide with Nicodemus for taking his part.
